  - machine learning
  - signal processing
abstract: >-
  Code for the EUSIPCO 2025 study and an all-fault PROTECT-90 evaluation of how
  data sparsity affects fault detection and line identification,
  covering individual relay failures, bus-level communication loss, downsampling,
  missing voltage or current channels, and intermittent block dropouts.
repository-code: "https://github.com/julianoelhaf/grid-protection-robustness"
